s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124586.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4253\n\n## Additional information\n\nIt achieves it by treating the metadata that begins with `__` as non-serializable, and it is additive to `_` not showing in the editor. I feel like making it additive is fine as you wouldn't usually want to show non-serializable metadata.\n\nThe \"editor-only\" metadata is still available after the game is exported. Don't get me wrong, it is still useful if your plugin has a runtime part to it, you can set some data in the editor that you can later retrieve when the game is running and it will work after export, but when you don't need it, e.g. your plugin is purely editor only and you use metadata to attach extra context to native types, you are now also storing unneeded info that will be present in the game after the export.\n\n<details>\n<summary>PR export test:</summary>\n\nThe game was launched after the export, so the error is good here, it means the logic works correctly.\n<img width=\"920\" height=\"525\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5676e241-b7d6-470d-b091-957220f3959d\" />\n</details>\n\nThe current usage of matching metadata [`get_meta(\"__`](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Agodotengine%2Fgodot+%22get_meta%28%5C%22__%22&type=code) and [`set_meta(\"__`](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Agodotengine%2Fgodot+%22set_meta%28%5C%22__%22&type=code) are only as temporary values or in not saved objects, so no changes in behaviour is expected in the Godot itself.\n\nThe usage in the whole github [`get_meta(\"__`](https://github.com/search?q=language%3AGDScript+%22get_meta%28%5C%22__%22&type=code) and [`set_meta(\"__`](https://github.com/search?q=language%3AGDScript+%22set_meta%28%5C%22__%22&type=code) also uses them as temporary variables or in non saved objects, so it shouldn't change the behaviour here as well.\n\nNo AI used.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124586/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124586/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}